## ImportedPostStatusMachine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    Draft
    Ready
    Scheduled
    Published
    [*] --> Draft
    [*] --> Ready
    Draft --> Ready: submit
    Ready --> Scheduled: schedule
    Ready --> Published: publish
    Scheduled --> Published: publish
    Ready --> Draft: retract
    Scheduled --> Draft: retract
    Scheduled --> Scheduled: reschedule
    Published --> [*]
```

